; Water smoke test (owner's sign-off session): the swim-boat start -- the player in deep water off the
; Everon bay beach, an empty BoatW fifteen metres to his left -- but he cannot die. A test mission ends
; the whole game three seconds after the player dies, and a player left floating while the camera
; flies elsewhere drowns or is thrown about by a storm sea: on 2026-10-13 that closed the owner's
; session in the middle of his test.
setViewDistance 1500
player setPos [9950, 1430, 0]
player setDir 180
player switchCamera "EXTERNAL"
testBoat = "BoatW" createVehicle [9935, 1424, 0]
testBoat setDir 180
~2
hint "Water smoke test: you cannot die here. Swim with W, board the boat with the action menu."
#keepalive
player setDammage 0
~0.5
goto "keepalive"
